# Agent location map
# The map uses MapLibre GL with raster tiles. No API key is required.
#
# Base layers:
#   Satellite - Esri World Imagery (default)
#   Map       - OpenStreetMap standard tiles
#
# Both default endpoints are fine for development and low volume only.
# Before production, point these at imagery you are licensed for
# (self-hosted tiles or a commercial provider). Placeholders must be
# {z}/{x}/{y} for street and {z}/{y}/{x} for Esri-style services.
# VITE_SATELLITE_TILE_URL=""
# VITE_STREET_TILE_URL=""
